    "faq_search": "Gushakisha mu FAQ...",
    "all_topics": "Umuntu Wose",
    "faq_ai_scoring": "Umuntu akora gute sisitemu ya AI y'Gupima Amanota?",
    "faq_ai_scoring_answer": "Sisitema ya AI isomera inyandiko zashyizweho n'amakuru y'umukoresha kugira ngo wemeze ubwoko bw'imyanzuro. Isondera ubwoko bwinyandiko, iguhitamo amakuru y'umukoresha no kwiyandikisha ibikenewe. Sisitema ihatanga imvugurumibare y'ubwoko n'igitekerezo cy'admin.",
    "faq_farmer_docs": "Inyandiko zig ibikenewe kuveriza ababimyi?",
    "faq_farmer_docs_answer": "Ababimyi bakeneye gutanga: Ubwiyunge bw'Akarima/Akayandikisho, Amafoto yabimyi, Inyandiko y'uburimyi (amezi 3 ashize), no Ubwiyunge bw'aho haba. Inyandiko zose zikeneye gukora neza no kureba.",
    "faq_create_listing": "Ubwiyunge n'uko mikora inyandiko nshya y'amanota?",
    "faq_create_listing_answer": "Kugenda Kuguza Amanota > Rikora Inyandiko Nshya. Uzuza izina ry'inyandiko, hitamo umwanya, injiza umubare n'igiciro k'amanota. Reba agaciro rusesuye kandi shyizaho. Amanota agakora hari kugura mwigishumi.",
    "faq_commission": "Niki amafaranga yo guza?",
    "faq_commission_answer": "Amafaranga yo guza atanuka mu mwanya: Umubimyi (5%), Amadozike (6%), Amagari ya Hybiride (4%), Ubucuruzi (7%). Ibyo bihurwa mu guza buri ikindi.",
    "faq_wallet_source": "Amanota yo mu konti ya mwenyikazi ashyira ahe?",
    "faq_wallet_source_answer": "Amanota y'admin konti iyerekeye abakoresha bacitswe neza bakabona kubyakore (uburimyi, amadozike, ...). Sisitema ikuranya amanota ikabiteka kubikorwa.",
    "faq_payouts": "Ibibazo bigahagurangira gute?",
    "faq_payouts_answer": "Ibibazo bigahagurangira iherezo ry'umwanya no kuri amagenamiterere y'amafaranga. Kwemeranya bwa kwezi kigatekerera guhagurangira kuri mwanya wose.",
    "faq_manage_users": "Ubwiyunge n'uko gushambura konti y'abakoresha?",
    "faq_manage_users_answer": "Mu Sisitemu Abakoresha, urashobora kureba abakoresha bose bakiyandikisha, guhitamo mu mwanya no imikorere, kandi gukora ibikorwa nka guhagarika cyangwa gusiba konti. Kubikorera ikintu cy'ibikorwa mu rworozi rw'umukoresha.",
    "faq_user_statuses": "Imikorere itanuka gute y'abakoresha?",
    "faq_user_statuses_answer": "Ikorera: Umukoresha nicitswe kandi ashobora guza. Igisubizo: Gisubiza kwemeza. Yatiriwe: Konti ihagaze. Idakorera: Umukoresha nta nkundo z'ibikorwa mu mahoro 60+.",
